Zero point energy                ...      0.01656948 Eh      10.40 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00016587 Eh       0.10 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00094418 Eh       0.59 kcal/mol
